- **R1/R2/R3** ✔ Two workers, both locks shared, both held during critical work.
- **R4** ✔ `Mutex::lock` blocks until free.
- **R5/R8** ✔ Both workers acquire in the same fixed order (a then b), so no circular wait; hence no deadlock under any interleaving.
